[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011200_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011200_01_0010","text":"凛世，怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011200_01_0020","text":"制作人大人……\n不……那个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011200_01_0030","text":"……啊，是特产店\n好，那我们去逛逛吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011200_01_0040","text":"……！\n但是……时间……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011200_01_0050","text":"只是稍微看看的话没问题的\n一起去吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011200_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011200_01_0060","text":"怎么样，找到想要的东西了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011200_01_0070","text":"是的……\n这个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011200_01_0080","text":"哦，当地的明信片套装\n要寄回老家吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011200_01_0090","text":"呵呵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011200_01_0100","text":"等寄到了……\n再慢慢……享受……"}]
